OL,3,GNEWSALamborghini driver guilty in M62
OL,4,Acrash death case
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe driver of a rented Lamborghini
OL,7,Fwhich hit speeds of more than 140mph
OL,8,F(230km/h) on a motorway has been found
OL,9,Fguilty of causing the death of her
OL,10,Ffriend in a crash.
OL,12,FHumaira Batool, from Bradford, was
OL,13,Fdriving the hired Urus model supercar
OL,14,Fbefore it struck a barrier on the M62
OL,15,Fand set alight, killing her 20-year-old
OL,16,Ffriend Mohammed Shaan Hussain.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
