OL,3,GNEWSALamborghini driver guilty in M62
OL,4,Acrash death case
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring a trial at Leeds Crown Court,
OL,7,Fjurors were told the Lamborghini was
OL,8,Fdriven by Batool "at grossly excessive
OL,9,Fspeeds of up to 143mph in wet
OL,10,Fconditions" on the motorway near
OL,11,FRipponden, West Yorkshire, in the early
OL,12,Fhours of 21 December 2022.
OL,14,FThe 26-year-old was found guilty of
OL,15,Fcausing death by dangerous driving and
OL,16,Fwill be sentenced on 2 November.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
